## Quick Start

### Import SDK

```typescript
import { TransactionAPI } from '{{packageName}}';

const api = new TransactionAPI({
  apiKey: 'your-api-key',
  environment: 'production'
});
```

### Create Transaction

```typescript
const transactions = await api.create([
  {
    amount: 100,
    description: 'Payment for services',
    externalId: 'ext-123'
  }
]);

console.log(transactions);
```

### Query Transactions

```typescript
const result = await api.query({
  limit: 10,
  after: null
});

console.log(result.transactions);
```

### Get Transaction by ID

```typescript
const transaction = await api.get('transaction-id-here');
console.log(transaction);
```

